Subject: [PATCH] Bluetooth: bcm4377: rebuild transport after S3 window loss

Recover BCM4377 through the HCI core close/open lifecycle.
Use PCIe FLR, retain DMA storage on failure, reload firmware and RTI,
and rerun PTB setup. Preserve an initially powered-off controller.
Hardware suspend validation is pending; do not merge as a proven fix.

---
